sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Auto Mode Flow (Ralph Wiggum Pattern)

    actor Developer
    participant CLI as specweave CLI
    participant State as auto-session.json
    participant Claude as Claude Code
    participant StopHook as stop-dispatcher.sh
    participant Reflect as stop-reflect.sh
    participant AutoHook as stop-auto-simple.sh
    participant Tasks as tasks.md
    participant Meta as MetadataManager

    Developer->>CLI: specweave auto 0042 --tdd

    CLI->>State: Create auto-session.json
    Note over State: status: running<br/>incrementIds: ["0042"]<br/>maxIterations: 2500

    CLI->>Claude: Start session with auto-system-prompt

    Note over Claude: Ralph Wiggum Pattern: Simple loop

    loop While tasks remain and iterations < max
        Claude->>Tasks: Read tasks.md
        Tasks-->>Claude: Find next [ ] pending task

        alt Task found
            Claude->>Claude: Execute task implementation
            Claude->>Tasks: Mark task [x] complete

            Note over Claude: Session naturally ends

            Claude->>StopHook: Stop hook triggered
            activate StopHook

            StopHook->>Reflect: Run reflect hook (always)
            activate Reflect
            Reflect->>Reflect: Extract learnings from session
            Reflect->>Reflect: Save to memory (async)
            Reflect-->>StopHook: decision: approve
            deactivate Reflect

            StopHook->>State: Check if auto session active
            State-->>StopHook: status: running

            StopHook->>AutoHook: Run auto hook
            activate AutoHook

            AutoHook->>Tasks: Check remaining tasks
            Tasks-->>AutoHook: 3 tasks remaining

            AutoHook->>State: Update iteration count
            State-->>AutoHook: iteration: 5

            AutoHook->>AutoHook: Build continuation prompt

            AutoHook-->>StopHook: decision: block<br/>systemMessage: Continue with next task
            deactivate AutoHook

            StopHook-->>Claude: block - continue session
            deactivate StopHook

            Note over Claude: Session continues (not terminated)

        else All tasks complete
            Claude->>Meta: Transition to READY_FOR_REVIEW
            Meta-->>Claude: Status updated

            Note over Claude: Session ends

            Claude->>StopHook: Stop hook triggered
            activate StopHook

            StopHook->>Reflect: Run reflect hook
            Reflect-->>StopHook: approve (learnings saved)

            StopHook->>AutoHook: Run auto hook
            activate AutoHook
            AutoHook->>Tasks: Check remaining tasks
            Tasks-->>AutoHook: 0 tasks remaining

            AutoHook->>State: Update status: completed
            AutoHook-->>StopHook: decision: approve<br/>reason: All tasks complete
            deactivate AutoHook

            StopHook-->>Claude: approve - session ends
            deactivate StopHook

            Claude-->>Developer: Auto session complete
        end
    end

    Note over Developer: Increment in READY_FOR_REVIEW<br/>Run /sw:done to complete
